#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was removed. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "Inodi ye-GPU isusiwe. Idivayisi yayo ye-Cacti ishiywe endaweni yayo."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was not removed because GPU records belong to it. Disable it instead; GPU records are never deleted."
msgstr "Inodi ye-GPU ayisuswanga ngoba amarekhodi e-GPU angawayo. Yikhubeze esikhundleni salokho; amarekhodi e-GPU awakaze asuswe."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU now belongs to the node it was seen at, with its history."
msgstr "I-GPU manje ingeyenodi eyabonakala kuyo, nomlando wayo."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU stays with its recorded node."
msgstr "I-GPU ihlala nenodi yayo erekhodiwe."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU will leave the data query at the next reindex. Its graphs and RRD files are kept."
msgstr "I-GPU izoshiya umbuzo wedatha ekuhleleni kabusha okulandelayo. Amagrafu ayo namafayela e-RRD kuyagcinwa."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Only an absent GPU can be removed from the data query."
msgstr "I-GPU engekho kuphela engasuswa embuzweni wedatha."

#: gpu_nodes.php
