#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "Saving adds the GPU data query to the device, with Cacti's automatic reindex turned off: the plugin reindexes after every GPU change. Configure the device's SNMP agent first; see docs/node-setup.md."
msgstr "Ukugcina kwengeza umbuzo wedatha we-GPU kudivayisi, ngokuhlela kabusha okuzenzakalelayo kwe-Cacti kuvaliwe: i-plugin ihlela kabusha ngemva kwazo zonke izinguquko ze-GPU. Misa umenzeli we-SNMP wedivayisi kuqala; bheka i-docs/node-setup.md."

#: lib/NodesPage.php
