#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "An absent GPU stays an index of the data query, so its graphs and RRD files stay attached and show a gap. Removing it from the data query stops that: at the next reindex Cacti no longer lists it, its graphs stop updating and its data sources show as orphaned, and its RRD files and graphs are kept until you delete them. The GPU record stays, and the GPU returns to the data query if it is reported again."
msgstr "I-GPU engekho ihlala iyinkomba yombuzo wedatha, ngakho amagrafu ayo namafayela e-RRD ahlala enamathiselwe futhi abonise igebe. Ukuyisusa embuzweni wedatha kumisa lokho: ekuhleleni kabusha okulandelayo i-Cacti ayisayifaki ohlwini, amagrafu ayo ayayeka ukubuyekezwa futhi imithombo yayo yedatha ibonakala njengezintandane, kanti amafayela ayo e-RRD namagrafu ayagcinwa uze uwasuse. Irekhodi le-GPU liyahlala, futhi i-GPU ibuyela embuzweni wedatha uma iphinde yabikwa."

