#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Consecutive successful collections that must miss a GPU before it is marked absent, from 1 to 100. A failed collection, or one that reports no GPUs, never counts. Absent GPUs keep their records and history and are never deleted automatically."
msgstr "Ukuqoqwa okulandelanayo okuphumelele okufanele kuphuthelwe i-GPU ngaphambi kokuba iphawulwe njengegekho, kusuka ku-1 kuya ku-100. Ukuqoqwa okuhlulekile, noma okubika ukuthi awekho ama-GPU, akubalwa nakanye. Ama-GPU angekho agcina amarekhodi nomlando wawo futhi awasulwa ngokuzenzakalelayo nakanye."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "GPU Collection"
msgstr "Ukuqoqwa kwe-GPU"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Iba Ndala Ngemva Kuka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds after the tool took a sample that its values stop being graphed, from 60 to 86400. An older value is reported as unknown, so a stopped collection shows as a gap, never as a flat line. The GPU age value keeps counting so it can be alerted on."
msgstr "Amasekhondi ngemva kokuba ithuluzi lithathe isampula lapho amanani alo eyeka ukufakwa kugrafu, kusuka ku-60 kuya ku-86400. Inani elidala kunalokho libikwa njengelingaziwa, ngakho ukuqoqwa okumisiwe kubonakala njengegebe, hhayi njengomugqa oqondile. Inani lobudala be-GPU liyaqhubeka libalwa ukuze kukhishwe isexwayiso ngalo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Khipha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gcina Amathebula E-plugin Uma Ukhipha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its node and GPU records. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export them first from GPU Nodes. Cacti devices, data sources, graphs, and RRD files are never touched either way."
msgstr "Uma kumakiwe, ukukhipha i-plugin kugcina amarekhodi ayo enodi kanye ne-GPU. Susa umaka ukuze ukukhipha kuwasuse; wathekelise kuqala kusuka ku-GPU Nodes. Amadivayisi e-Cacti, imithombo yedatha, amagrafu, kanye namafayela e-RRD awathintwa nakanye kunoma yikuphi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Remove the plugin's Cacti objects on uninstall"
msgstr "Susa izinto ze-Cacti ze-plugin uma ikhishwa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin also removes the GPU device template, data query, data template, and graph templates it imported, each only where nothing outside the plugin uses it, and the GPU data query XML it wrote, only if the file is unchanged. It never deletes RRD files, devices, graphs, or data sources; templates those still use are kept."
msgstr "Uma kumakiwe, ukukhipha i-plugin kuphinde kususe ithempulethi yedivayisi ye-GPU, umbuzo wedatha, ithempulethi yedatha, namathempulethi egrafu ewangenele, ngalinye kuphela lapho kungekho okunye ngaphandle kwe-plugin okusebenzisayo, kanye ne-XML yombuzo wedatha ye-GPU eliyibhalile, kuphela uma ifayela lingashintshiwe. Akususi nakanye amafayela e-RRD, amadivayisi, amagrafu, noma imithombo yedatha; amathempulethi asasetshenziswa yilezo zinto ayagcinwa."

